#. type: Title #
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Opening files directly in PhpStorm"
msgstr "Abrindo arquivos diretamente no PhpStorm"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "Yii error pages can show links that open stack trace files in PhpStorm at the failing line. This is useful in local development when the error page runs in a browser and the project is open in the IDE."
msgstr "As páginas de erro do Yii podem mostrar links que abrem os arquivos do stack trace no PhpStorm, na linha que falhou. Isso é útil no desenvolvimento local, quando a página de erro roda no navegador e o projeto está aberto na IDE."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check Toolbox links"
msgstr "Verifique os links do Toolbox"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PhpStorm supports Toolbox URLs that use the `jetbrains://` protocol. To get the `project` value and path format,\n"
"right-click a project file in the Project tool window and select **Copy Path/Reference** > **Toolbox URL**.\n"
"If the copied URL has `origin`, keep the `origin` parameter and its value in your links.\n"
msgstr ""
"O PhpStorm suporta URLs do Toolbox que usam o protocolo `jetbrains://`. Para obter o valor de `project` e o formato do caminho,\n"
"clique com o botão direito em um arquivo do projeto na janela Project e selecione **Copy Path/Reference** > **Toolbox URL**.\n"
"Se a URL copiada tiver `origin`, mantenha o parâmetro `origin` e o valor dele nos seus links.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "On Linux, check that Toolbox registered the protocol handler:"
msgstr "No Linux, verifique se o Toolbox registrou o handler do protocolo:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "xdg-mime query default x-scheme-handler/jetbrains\n"
msgstr "xdg-mime query default x-scheme-handler/jetbrains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "The command should print a Toolbox or JetBrains daemon desktop file, for example `jetbrainsd.desktop`."
msgstr "O comando deve imprimir um arquivo desktop do Toolbox ou do daemon da JetBrains, por exemplo `jetbrainsd.desktop`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "PhpStorm should be running with the project open when you click stack trace links."
msgstr "O PhpStorm deve estar rodando com o projeto aberto quando você clicar nos links do stack trace."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure error trace links"
msgstr "Configure os links do stack trace"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "The Yii application template configures `Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer` in `config/common/di/error-handler.php`. It reads a `traceLink` parameter and uses it for stack trace file links."
msgstr "O template de aplicação do Yii configura o `Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer` em `config/common/di/error-handler.php`. Ele lê um parâmetro `traceLink` e o usa nos links de arquivos do stack trace."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "Add the parameter to `config/common/params.php`:"
msgstr "Adicione o parâmetro em `config/common/params.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'traceLink' => 'jetbrains://phpstorm/navigate/reference?project=my-app&path={file}:{line}',\n"
"    // Other parameters.\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'traceLink' => 'jetbrains://phpstorm/navigate/reference?project=my-app&path={file}:{line}',\n"
"    // Outros parâmetros.\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "Replace `my-app` with the `project` value from the Toolbox URL. If the Toolbox URL uses `origin`, keep `origin` in the link template and use its value."
msgstr "Substitua `my-app` pelo valor de `project` da URL do Toolbox. Se a URL do Toolbox usar `origin`, mantenha `origin` no template do link e use o valor dele."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "After that, open a debug error page and click a file link in the stack trace."
msgstr "Depois disso, abra uma página de erro em modo debug e clique em um link de arquivo no stack trace."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map Docker paths to host paths"
msgstr "Mapeie os caminhos do Docker para os caminhos do host"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "When the application runs in Docker, stack traces usually contain container paths such as `/app/src/...`.  PhpStorm needs the matching host path."
msgstr "Quando a aplicação roda no Docker, os stack traces geralmente contêm caminhos do container, como `/app/src/...`.  O PhpStorm precisa do caminho correspondente no host."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "Set `APP_HOST_PATH` in `docker/dev/override.env` to the project path on the host machine. Set `APP_IDE_PROJECT` to the `project` value from a Toolbox URL. If the URL uses `origin`, store the `origin` value instead and use `origin` in the final URL template:"
msgstr "Defina `APP_HOST_PATH` em `docker/dev/override.env` com o caminho do projeto na máquina host. Defina `APP_IDE_PROJECT` com o valor de `project` de uma URL do Toolbox. Se a URL usar `origin`, guarde o valor de `origin` e use `origin` no template final da URL:"

#. type: Fenced code block (dotenv)
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"APP_HOST_PATH=/home/user/projects/my-app\n"
"APP_IDE_PROJECT=my-app\n"
msgstr ""
"APP_HOST_PATH=/home/user/projects/my-app\n"
"APP_IDE_PROJECT=my-app\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "`docker/dev/override.env` is for developer-specific settings and shouldn't be committed. See [Override env files](../guide/tutorial/docker.md#override-env-files) for details."
msgstr "O `docker/dev/override.env` é para configurações específicas de cada desenvolvedor e não deve ser commitado. Veja [Arquivos env de override](../guide/tutorial/docker.md#arquivos-env-de-override) para mais detalhes."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "In the application parameters, expose these environment values as `$params['app']['hostPath']` and `$params['app']['ideProject']`."
msgstr "Nos parâmetros da aplicação, exponha esses valores de ambiente como `$params['app']['hostPath']` e `$params['app']['ideProject']`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "With the default application template, `/app/src/Web/HomePage/Action.php` will be linked as `/home/user/projects/my-app/src/Web/HomePage/Action.php`."
msgstr "Com o template de aplicação padrão, `/app/src/Web/HomePage/Action.php` será linkado como `/home/user/projects/my-app/src/Web/HomePage/Action.php`."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure `HtmlRenderer` manually"
msgstr "Configure o `HtmlRenderer` manualmente"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "If your application doesn't have the template's `error-handler.php` configuration, configure `HtmlRenderer` directly:"
msgstr "Se a sua aplicação não tiver a configuração `error-handler.php` do template, configure o `HtmlRenderer` diretamente:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    HtmlRenderer::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'traceLink' => 'jetbrains://phpstorm/navigate/reference?project=my-app&path={file}:{line}',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    HtmlRenderer::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'traceLink' => 'jetbrains://phpstorm/navigate/reference?project=my-app&path={file}:{line}',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
msgid "For Docker, use a closure to map the container path to the host path:"
msgstr "Para o Docker, use uma closure para mapear o caminho do container para o caminho do host:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/opening-files-in-phpstorm.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"$hostPath = rtrim($params['app']['hostPath'], '/') . '/';\n"
"$project = $params['app']['ideProject'];\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    HtmlRenderer::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'traceLink' => static function (string $file, ?int $line) use ($hostPath, $project): string {\n"
"                $file = preg_replace('~^/app/~', $hostPath, $file);\n"
"                $path = $line === null ? $file : $file . ':' . $line;\n"
"\n"
"                return str_replace(\n"
"                    ['{project}', '{path}'],\n"
"                    [$project, $path],\n"
"                    'jetbrains://phpstorm/navigate/reference?project={project}&path={path}',\n"
"                );\n"
"            },\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\HtmlRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"$hostPath = rtrim($params['app']['hostPath'], '/') . '/';\n"
"$project = $params['app']['ideProject'];\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    HtmlRenderer::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'traceLink' => static function (string $file, ?int $line) use ($hostPath, $project): string {\n"
"                $file = preg_replace('~^/app/~', $hostPath, $file);\n"
"                $path = $line === null ? $file : $file . ':' . $line;\n"
"\n"
"                return str_replace(\n"
"                    ['{project}', '{path}'],\n"
"                    [$project, $path],\n"
"                    'jetbrains://phpstorm/navigate/reference?project={project}&path={path}',\n"
"                );\n"
"            },\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
